; Protected entry: one outer FP input file plus the shared build at depth two.
; Only the temporary ptxt10 is edited; the original guest input is restored.
; Keep generation commands, options and printer support in sim4000.mops.
head cpu
mode list.yes
o pkeditlog
; Compact padded imports to leave room within the existing 2000-segment claim.
pkcompact=copy montxt10
clear temp montxt10
rename pkcompact.montxt10
pkcompact=copy mcommon
clear temp mcommon
rename pkcompact.mcommon
ptxt10=edit montxt10
l./e22:/
l./     jl       x2               ; 94-06-01 21:03 HJ , skip set pk action/
d0
f
o c
rename montxt10.pkoriginal
rename ptxt10.montxt10
i mcommon
rename montxt10.ptxt10
rename pkoriginal.montxt10
